  n<//> u<12> t<LINE_COMMENT> p<1848> s<13> l<11:1> el<11:3>
  n<// 2. Page 676 that macros with default arguments can be optionally separated by> u<13> t<LINE_COMMENT> p<1848> s<14> l<12:1> el<12:81>
