  n<//> u<18> t<LINE_COMMENT> p<1848> s<19> l<17:1> el<17:3>
  n<// 4. Page 679 states that macro argument substitution should not be done inside> u<19> t<LINE_COMMENT> p<1848> s<20> l<18:1> el<18:81>
